error[8-0151]: `note` needs `Log` after its closure's effects are inferred
   ┌─ late_closure_effects.fe:44:17
   │
43 │       let g = || {
   │ ╭─────────────'
44 │ │         let r = W { v: x }.note()
   │ │                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this call's effects are known only after the closure's body is checked
45 │ │     }
   │ ╰─────' this closure's effects are inferred from its body, without `Log`
   │
   = annotate the types the call depends on in the closure's body, so that it resolves there

